Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:25.29,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,All ships, fall back!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.29,0:00:29.00,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Put distance between us so we don't get hit \Nby the light, and continue our assault!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.51,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,MARIA, how are Shido, Tohka, and the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.65,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,I still don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:36.42,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,That object is disrupting my visuals.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:41.39,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Furthermore, what appears to be a different \NAngel has manifested on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:43.14,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Please analyze them quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:47.77,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Rei-nyan is gone, so I guess \NI'm the only one who's free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:50.34,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,I'll figure it out somehow with Spirit Power!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.03,0:00:52.69,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:04.10,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.10,0:03:05.20,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:08.62,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,We just need to make it \Nto that ship called Fraxinus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.11,0:03:12.83,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:14.86,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:17.18,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,Captain Kusakabe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:19.60,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,We heard from Tobiichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.13,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,A-And you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.62,0:03:24.72,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,Hinako Shizaki, crew member of Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.72,0:03:28.92,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,We used our teleporter \Nto transfer you all into the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:32.45,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,Now, bring your soldiers \Nand Artemisia this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.02,0:03:34.46,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:35.85,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,They're my precious friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.85,0:03:36.90,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Please take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:40.15,Main,Staff,0,0,0,,I can't make you any promises, \Nbut we'll do everything we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:53.57,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Welcome to Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.41,0:03:56.04,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I'm the commander, Kotori Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.90,0:04:00.78,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,I'm Ryoko Kusakabe, \Nformer member of the JSDF AST.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:01.80,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.05,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Y-You're the commander?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:07.81,Main,Nakatsugawa,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a nostalgic reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.81,0:04:12.46,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,We've all gotten used to it, \Nbut normally it would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.36,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,Having a middle school girl \Nas our commander and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.30,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:18.69,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:19.88,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Please forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.88,0:04:24.20,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,for foolishly trying to judge your capability \Nbased on your age and appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:27.09,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for your flexibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.68,0:04:30.25,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Though I'm sorry we don't have the leeway
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:33.31,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,to hold a welcoming party \Nnow that you've joined us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:34.81,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:36.81,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,I understand the circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:38.48,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.48,0:04:40.98,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,We've finished retrieving Artemisia.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.98,0:04:41.84,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Kannazuki,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.80,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,you're all set, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:45.06,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,We're cutting through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:45.86,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.86,0:04:47.59,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:50.46,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.23,0:04:55.37,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,C-Captain Kannazuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.37,0:04:57.65,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.65,0:05:00.61,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Ohh, long time no see, Kusakabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:02.86,Main,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Kannazuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:04.74,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:10.46,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,He was captain of the AST \Nwhen I was first stationed with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.87,0:05:14.34,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,He was the squad's indisputable top ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:16.74,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Wow, that man was?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:18.25,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,That's kind of cool, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.57,0:05:22.00,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,You used to do that, Kannazuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:26.76,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,I always thought you were just someone \Nthe Commander picked up off the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.76,0:05:29.51,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Commander Itsuka, this man is dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.42,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,He's the kind of pervert who dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.42,0:05:34.01,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,about having a middle \Nschool girl kick him in the butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.01,0:05:37.46,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,He would launch "protect middle school \Ngirls meetings" during our missions,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:40.05,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,and when he watched local \Nmiddle schoolers going to school
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:43.03,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,he got reported as a suspicious individual!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:45.53,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,You're right in his strike zone, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:46.96,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.96,0:05:49.53,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Lately I prefer them stepping on me \Nwith the heel of their feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.53,0:05:51.74,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,It's somewhat plain, but quite superb...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:57.25,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,We have no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.25,0:06:00.37,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,MARIA, punch through \Nthe DEM ships ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.37,0:06:02.30,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,We're launching an attack on Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.30,0:06:05.26,Main - Italics,MARIA,0,0,0,,Roger, authorizing activation of Gungnir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:07.52,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What are you doing still sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:11.85,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Ratatoskr doesn't pay you to take naps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:13.26,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.57,0:06:15.52,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Now, let's go, MARIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.97,0:06:17.56,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,For the sake of the Spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:22.09,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,and above all, for more rewards \Nfrom our Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.47,0:06:24.96,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:28.51,Main,Soldier,0,0,0,,Are you serious about that guy \Nbeing our top ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.36,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:34.56,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,But that Kyohei Kannazuki was known as \N"The Walking HR Complaint"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.56,0:06:40.02,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,and "The Man With Valued Skills, \NAnd Criminal Fetishes",
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.02,0:06:43.63,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,so that Commander is something else \Nfor taming him to this degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:47.62,Main - Italics,MARIA,0,0,0,,Launching Yggdrafolium 1 through 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.62,0:06:50.01,Main - Italics,MARIA,0,0,0,,I'll drive away the enemy ships before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:52.55,Main - Italics,MARIA,0,0,0,,Once we pass through, support the Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:11.36,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Analysis complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:13.65,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Though what is all this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:14.87,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Nia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:18.00,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,What's the matter is whatever is \Ngoing on with that Angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:20.00,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,It couldn't be anymore dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:23.18,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,That light causes all living creatures \Nwithout exception to die,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.00,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,and all objects to break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:28.53,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,It's like it's reducing everything's lifespan
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.53,0:07:31.93,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,or durability to zero in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:35.30,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,To put it simply, it's an instant death beam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.74,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,This would definitely get rejected \Nif it were drawn in a manga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.74,0:07:41.31,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to defeat that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.31,0:07:43.62,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,As for the other thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:47.69,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,It's like that region around her \Nis a completely different world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:52.21,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,If we got a little closer I might be able \Nto make out what it's like inside, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.74,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Kotori, I propose that we \Ndisconnect the sections
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.74,0:07:59.66,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,containing that unconscious woman we just \Nreceived and the non-combatants,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:02.46,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,ejecting them to Ulmus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.77,0:08:04.11,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,MARIA...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:06.57,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Of course, I have no intention of losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.99,0:08:09.02,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,It's merely for risk reduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.37,0:08:12.02,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Thank you, MARIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:14.30,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,For taking initiative to propose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:18.62,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,No, it's only natural since an AI's \Nprocessing speed is faster than humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.02,0:08:23.85,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Captain Kusakabe, you've heard the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:27.54,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Could I ask you to guard the ejected sections?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.50,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:31.21,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,No, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:32.86,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.12,0:08:36.21,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Captain, you're a wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.21,0:08:38.37,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I definitely want you to work under me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:47.25,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Now, sorry everyone, but you're \Njoining me on the path to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:51.88,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,If you want to flee, you should \Nfollow those girls right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.20,0:08:54.51,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Commander?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.77,0:08:57.89,Main,Nakatsugawa,0,0,0,,After coming this far, \Nwe're with you all the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:09:02.14,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,For one thing, it's too dangerous to leave \Nyou alone with the Vice Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:03.89,Main,Minow,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:07.09,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:08.16,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Then let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:09.70,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I love you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:10.44,Main,Crew,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:19.09,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,I've forced our way through \Nthe enemy ships' Territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:21.20,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Kotori, ready the main cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.01,0:09:29.38,Main,Nakatsugawa,0,0,0,,I've confirmed what's inside that space!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:33.58,Main,Nakatsugawa,0,0,0,,At the center is Analyst Murasame—\NNo, Mio Takamiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:36.33,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,She's fighting Tohka and Tobiichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:37.63,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What about the others?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:43.21,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,Around her... Yoshino, Kaguya, Yuzuru, \Nand Mukuro have fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.77,0:09:46.89,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,There are no life signs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:47.64,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.65,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Target: Mio Takamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.74,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Gungnir, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:05.73,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:07.66,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Aren't you coming after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.66,0:10:11.17,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,If you aren't, then I'll go ahead \Nand come after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.57,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Origami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.57,0:10:18.38,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:21.22,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:33.07,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Einherjar!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.85,0:11:31.82,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.25,0:11:35.47,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,No, I suppose I should call you Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:38.55,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Either one is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.25,0:11:42.55,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:44.41,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Was everything a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:49.45,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,The fact that you saved me, \Nthe fact that you kept supporting me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.45,0:11:52.19,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,and the fact that you \Ncalled me your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:55.12,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Were all of those, all of those a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:56.61,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It wasn't a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.11,0:12:03.07,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I treasure all of the Spirits, \Nand I loved everyone aboard Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.38,0:12:07.63,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,And I still consider you \Nmy one and only best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.54,0:12:09.46,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.83,0:12:14.65,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I would consume even my best friend \Nif I must to bring back Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.65,0:12:15.96,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:32.97,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:36.57,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,That's absurd...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.82,0:12:46.94,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Raphael!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.95,0:12:48.97,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.36,0:12:55.71,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.54,0:12:58.85,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.28,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:09.35,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's simple, but it's a not bad move, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:14.25,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,You've sure had your way with us until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:16.60,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,So it's time to take responsibility!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:20.85,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:29.89,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:32.14,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Did he wipe himself out with his own attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.14,0:13:35.21,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Maybe he knew he didn't stand a chance \Nagainst us and blew himself up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:38.58,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Father, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:40.84,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Hmm, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.62,0:13:45.47,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:48.52,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:51.96,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,What am I doing attacking Father?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.96,0:13:54.10,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Rebelling? Is it my rebellious phase?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:58.98,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Y-You!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:01.73,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,How dare you attack Father looking like me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:05.98,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,You used Haniel's power \Nto transform into Nibeelcole?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.98,0:14:08.33,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,That's a smart play,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:11.12,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,but that also made it easy to predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.77,0:14:18.56,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,My Demon King, Beelzebub, allows me \Nto know everything in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.56,0:14:24.25,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,So naturally I looked into what kind \Nof powers each Spirit possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:31.97,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's about time to draw the curtain on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:38.77,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I need to obtain the remaining \NSpirit Power before I encounter Deus,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:42.57,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,so I can create a new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:46.15,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,A new world?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:47.68,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.68,0:14:53.96,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Me, Elliot, Ellen, and Karen are different \Nfrom those manufactured Wizards.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:58.66,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,We're the true descendants \Nof magic users, known as Magi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.15,0:15:02.90,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Though one day the humans who feared our power
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:07.15,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,burned down our village and \Nslaughtered everyone we knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:13.55,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,That's why we're going to overwrite \Nthis world using Deus' power,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.05,0:15:16.89,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,and get our revenge on humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.97,0:15:23.06,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Does that reasoning make it easier to accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:24.47,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.07,0:15:29.32,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,To be honest, my reason isn't all that grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:31.57,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,In my case,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:36.26,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,my standards for what I find enjoyable and \Nunpleasant are slightly different from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.26,0:15:37.91,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,That's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:41.98,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,In all other regards, \NI'm not different from others.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.98,0:15:47.93,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'm just putting in honest effort in pursuit \Nof my curiosity and the goals I seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.33,0:15:54.01,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,In that sense, I'm a perfectly average person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.34,0:15:58.37,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Now, we've talked for long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.37,0:16:01.10,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Farewell, Shido Itsuka,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:02.58,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.49,0:16:07.11,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Shinji Takamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:12.84,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.89,0:16:15.10,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Natsumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.82,0:16:23.67,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Darling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.67,0:16:25.29,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.29,0:16:26.54,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,You were nearly a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.94,0:16:27.89,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:29.13,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:32.50,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,What on earth is going on \Nin this battle right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.50,0:16:35.18,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,We've lost contact with everyone else...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:38.69,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Also, isn't that the enemy's leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.69,0:16:40.62,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'll share the details later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:42.81,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,The Spirit of Origin has manifested.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:46.56,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I need to defeat him as quickly as possible \Nso I can rejoin everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.56,0:16:49.19,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Wha?! The Spirit of Origin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.50,0:16:52.50,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Then we really do need to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:56.45,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,I'm kicking it up for everyone \Nand you, Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:08.04,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Oh? Diva and Witch, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:09.53,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'm happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.53,0:17:12.51,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'll be able to obtain two Sephirah too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.19,0:17:16.35,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,What should we do, Darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.06,0:17:22.01,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Should we attack the leader while \Nyou take down Nibeelcole?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.02,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.02,0:17:27.39,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,In order to defeat him, \Nwe'll need an attack he can't predict,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:31.09,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,or an attack he can't evade \Neven if he can predict it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:34.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Both of you enhance me \Nwith Gabriel's performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.17,0:17:36.56,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,That'll be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.56,0:17:37.41,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:40.38,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Sounds like you have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.38,0:17:42.66,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,All right, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.87,0:17:51.85,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Nothing you do is going to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:55.55,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,We'll make all three of you \Nkneel before Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.84,0:17:57.05,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.16,0:18:01.97,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Halvanhelv!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:23.79,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.18,0:18:34.60,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Omniscience, the power to know \Nabsolutely everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:38.97,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It seems you're still naive \Nabout what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.34,0:18:54.61,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, I figured you would \Nblock it, knowing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.41,0:18:59.12,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You're right that it's only natural
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.12,0:19:02.37,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,to look up the Angels' power \Nas soon as you obtained Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:04.74,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,And since I'm not the original owner,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:07.87,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,of course the power is weakened when I use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:10.13,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But you know what,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:13.13,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,did you learn this from Beelzebub?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:14.96,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Did you look it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:18.45,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Did you, omniscient Westcott?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.14,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:24.30,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Roaring Flash Blast Wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:44.82,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:45.81,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:54.02,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Looks like you've beaten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.33,0:19:59.41,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I guess this is the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.94,0:20:02.53,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It came surprisingly soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.81,0:20:14.18,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Jeez, you surprised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:17.31,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Yeah. I thought you would kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.10,0:20:19.01,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:20.98,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I wanted to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.50,0:20:25.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,To be honest, I thought he might die \Nwhen I fired off that last attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.90,0:20:28.14,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,That last attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.14,0:20:30.04,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,That Roaring whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.04,0:20:31.58,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Uhh, ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:35.10,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure what to say about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.66,0:20:39.47,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,but I think it would be wrong to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:41.78,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I don't want to be like they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.50,0:20:44.50,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Even if I feel bad toward Shinji for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:46.59,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:50.22,Main,Natsumi,0,0,0,,Well, that's fine too, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.78,0:20:52.78,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.78,0:20:55.73,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,You'll never get a chance like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:57.36,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:59.23,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,The loser doesn't get a say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:04.60,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,You sound just like Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.60,0:21:06.43,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.43,0:21:11.10,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I was curious what death would feel like too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:21.50,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.83,0:21:23.61,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.55,0:21:28.14,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Miku! Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:31.53,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.71,0:21:35.58,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.57,0:21:39.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Wh-Where is everyone...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:42.87,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I've recovered all the Sephirah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.31,0:21:45.58,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Along with their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.55,0:21:52.18,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Now we can be together forever, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.05,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 7
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.05,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}The World Tree Sheds Leaves
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.05,0:23:40.07,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs18\pos(604,310)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 8 "The One Who Pulled the Trigger"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:30.05,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Shido is thrown into despair \Nat the deaths of his friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:32.78,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,but who appears in that final moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.78,0:23:36.64,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next time is Episode 8: \NThe One Who Pulled the Trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.64,0:23:39.37,Main - Top,Narrator,0,0,0,,Wipe away your tears, and fight, Shido.
